  "kerala/cherai": ["Cherai Beach", "A beach lined with coconut palms on one side and backwaters on the other."],
  "kerala/ayurveda": ["An Ayurvedic massage", "Warm oils and slow movements, in the land that made Ayurveda a medicine."],
