  "katmandou/nagarkot": ["Sunrise over the Himalayas at Nagarkot", "On a clear day, the Himalayan range from Annapurna to Everest."],
  "sri-lanka/galle-face": ["Galle Face Green", "A lawn facing the ocean, kites, and the vendors’ shrimp fritters."],
