  "rishikesh/yoga": ["A yoga class", "In the town that calls itself the yoga capital of the world, facing the river."],
  "rishikesh/ram-jhula": ["The Ram Jhula suspension bridge", "A footbridge over the Ganges, ashrams on both banks and cows crossing too."],
