  "toulouse/capitole": ["Place du Capitole", "Pink brick at sunset, the Occitan cross set into the ground, and the painted halls of the city hall."],
  "toulouse/saint-sernin": ["The Basilica of Saint-Sernin", "The largest surviving Romanesque church in Europe, a stop on the Way of St. James."],
