  "lille/citadelle-lille": ["Vauban’s citadel and the Bois de Boulogne", "A Vauban star fort still used by the army, and the park around it on the banks of the Deûle."],
  "lille/wazemmes": ["Wazemmes market", "On Sunday mornings, three hundred stalls, brick market halls and an accordion in the middle."],
  "montpellier/comedie": ["Place de la Comédie and the Écusson", "The “Egg,” the Fountain of the Three Graces, then the lanes and mansions of the old center."],
  "montpellier/fabre": ["The Musée Fabre", "Courbet, Bazille, and a whole room of Pierre Soulages, a son of the region."],
